    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🏡 Real Estate Lead Automation – Enhanced\n\n**Flow:**\nWebhook → Normalize → Save Sheet → Groq AI → Parse → Update Score + Send Email → Wait 1 Day → Follow-up → Update Status\n\n**Improvements over v1:**\n✅ response_format: json_object (reliable JSON from Groq)\n✅ Fallback email if AI fails\n✅ Lead score + intent saved back to sheet\n✅ Subject line adapts to lead score (≥70 = priority)\n✅ Follow-up references exact property/budget/location\n✅ Follow-up status tracked in sheet\n✅ urgency field added to AI output\n\n**Sheet columns needed:**\nTimestamp | Name | Email | Location | Property Type | Budget | Message | Lead Score | Intent | Follow Up Status",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
